+- `--threshold <metric>=<min>` – set a minimum passing score for a metric (0–1, can be specified multiple times). Valid metrics: `exact_match`, `toxicity`, `length_variance`. If any threshold fails, exit code is 1; usage errors (malformed threshold or unknown metric) exit with code 2. The report is written either way and records pass/fail status.
 
